@startuml
title unwatch PATH — Remove a watched path
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor "User" as U
participant "TerminalUI" as UI
participant "DebugSession" as S
U -> UI : unwatch PATH
UI -> S : remove_watch(PATH)
S -> S : Check that PATH is registered
S -> S : Remove watched path or raise command error
UI -> UI : show_watches()
UI --> U : Result or command error; return to prompt
@enduml
